WEBVTT

00:19:26.352 --> 00:19:30.456
Pratite tragove. Izgubite se. Iznenadite se, inspirišite, zabavite se.

00:19:30.456 --> 00:19:35.075
Sva ta "šta", sva ta "kako" su tu negde,

00:19:35.075 --> 00:19:37.538
čekaju da otkrijete njihovo "zašto",

00:19:37.569 --> 00:19:40.627
da zaronite i prenesete ih.

00:19:40.627 --> 00:19:43.125
Hvala vam.

00:19:43.125 --> 00:19:50.237
(Aplauz)